    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><img class=\" size-full wp-image-475 aligncenter\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/ashurst.jpg\" alt=\"ashurst\" width=\"258\" height=\"66\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The strong Intellectual Property team at Ashurst is acting for Samsung in its dispute with Apple.</strong> The lawyers here are very experienced and led by a highly effective litigator.  The IP group in Australia provides a full range of services and the firm rightly prides itself on its global presence and impressive industry sector coverage. Ashurst LLP is our award for ‘Best IP Team’, Australia, 2013.</p>",
